{
  "description": "Type Data Catalog's 403 'No permission to \u2026 or it does not exist' on entry group, entry and tag operations. It surfaced as a plain Forbidden, indistinguishable from a real denial, so a caller couldn't tell a missing resource from a missing grant.",
