          "smithy.api#httpError": 403,
          "smithy.api#documentation": "Data Catalog answers a missing entry group, entry or tag and a denied permission alike, with HTTP 403 PERMISSION_DENIED: \"No permission to delete Entry \\\"...\\\" or it does not exist.\" Verified live 2026-10-29 with a caller holding datacatalog.entries.delete.",
